# Custom AI Skills Registry: {{ PROJECT_NAME }}

This document catalogues the bespoke AI agent skills available in this repository.
`.agents/skills/` in this repository is the **source of truth**; it is tracked in git, so skills
travel with a clone.

## Where these skills live

| Path | Role | In git? | Read by |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `.agents/skills/` | **Source of truth.** Edit here. | **Yes** — tracked in git | Gemini, Antigravity, generic agents |
| `.claude/skills/` | Junction / symlink onto `.agents/skills/` | No (gitignored) | Claude Code (auto-loads this path) |

Recreating the junction after a fresh clone:
- **Windows:** `cmd /c mklink /J .claude\skills .agents\skills`
- **Linux/macOS:** `ln -s ../.agents/skills .claude/skills`

